  "body": "Automated bridge job `RQ-REBASE-PHANTOM-4742` (pool: codex-personal), single commit on base `0241e65ef`.\n\n**Tests:** no test command\n\n<details><summary>Agent notes</summary>\n\n# RQ-REBASE-PHANTOM-4742\n\nStatus: prepared locally; existing PR #4742 remains open and conflicting. No commit, push, publish, new PR, or enqueue performed. The task's final rule explicitly requires uncommitted work. GitHub CLI also cannot read its protected config; an empty temporary GH_CONFIG_DIR has no authentication.\n\nPR head: `masonwyatt23/phantom:codex-bridge/RQ-UPKEEP-DOCS-phantom-20261110` at `d0f90fce53f0a93e79e3d9ff41052d91f5bdbdad`. Resolved delta is unstaged on job branch `codex-bridge/RQ-REBASE-PHANTOM-4742`, based on master `1a9fdfea64`. This job must update #4742 only; do not publish this job branch as another PR.\n\nThe original 53-file PR combines docs upkeep with code already integrated upstream. A scratch `git merge-tree --write-tree` found 20 conflicting paths. Preserved current release versions, Slack receiver types, screenshots/corrections, flag-only refusal behavior, and existing interject receipts. Carried forward remaining docs, workbench read-verb help, completions, regression coverage, and removal of obsolete root handoff files. Inserted curated 3.30.32 notes into the existing historical section, retaining generated release entries and avoiding duplicate release headings. Regenerated docs from current source/version (3.30.33). Added the existing `apps request` verb to completions after doc-facts exposed the omission.\n\nCommands and outcomes:\n\n- `npm install -g @ashlr/phantom`: failed EPERM at host installation. `npm install --global --prefix /tmp/phantom-rq4742-cli @ashlr/phantom`: passed; isolated CLI 3.30.33. Ran `phm docs --agent --json`, `phm help`, `phm mcp list --json`, `phm mcp doctor --json`, `phm wire status --json`; repeated docs/list/wire with isolated CLI. Wire unavailable; MCP doctor reports several unavailable adapters. No gateway registration or auth changes. Companion tools called: none; toolsUsed: [].\n- `gh pr view 4742 -R ashlrai/phantom --json number,state,isDraft,title,headRefName,headRepository,headRepositoryOwner,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,url,statusCheckRollup`: failed protected config read. Same command with `GH_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/phantom-gh-rq4742`: failed unauthenticated. Public `curl --fail --silent --show-error` reads of PR, PR files and head check-runs succeeded; observed only neutral CodeRabbit, no successful Merge Gate.\n- `git fetch origin master pull/4742/head`; `git merge --ff-only origin/master`: passed, fast-forward only. `git merge-tree --write-tree origin/master d0f90fce53f0a93e79e3d9ff41052d91f5bdbdad`: conflict diagnostic only; no merge commit. Applied reviewed residual tree contents without staging.\n- `npm run install:worktree`: passed (pnpm 10.28.2, wt-deps and tsc-warm successful). Initial verification failed to resolve a Vitest chunk while dependencies were being restored. No authority snapshot regeneration was warranted.\n- `node scripts/docs-sync.mjs --local --json`; `HOME=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/rq4742-docgen.XXXXXX)\" node scripts/docs-sync.mjs --json`: passed, regenerated local surfaces and both CLI references.\n- `npm run check:docs`: passed twice (last run after README repair).\n- `HOME=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/rq4742-tests.XXXXXX)\" npm run test:ci -- test/wb-secrets-cli.test.ts test/wb-locus.test.ts test/wb-steer.test.ts test/doc-facts.test.ts test/docs-sync.test.ts test/cli-docs-drift.test.ts test/repo-root-strays.test.ts test/cli-completions-subcommands.test.ts test/fleet-registry-complete.test.ts`: 56 passed, 3 failed in 9 files. Failures were missing `apps request` completion and stale generated CLI docs; both subsequently corrected.\n- `HOME=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/rq4742-retest.XXXXXX)\" npm run test:ci -- test/doc-facts.test.ts test/cli-docs-drift.test.ts test/cli-completions-subcommands.test.ts`: 23 passed, 1 timed out (5-second test deadline on a second CLI-generator invocation). Both content matching and all verb checks passed. `HOME=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/rq4742-doccheck.XXXXXX)\" node scripts/generate-cli-docs.mjs --check`: passed independently; docs are up to date.\n- `node scripts/verify-changed.mjs`: failed dependency resolution before authority assertions. Final run `HOME=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/rq4742-verify.XXXXXX)\" NODE_PATH=\"$PWD/node_modules/.pnpm/node_modules\" node scripts/verify-changed.mjs`: failed, 7 passed / 3 failed across the two authority suites. CODEOWNERS lacks 9 existing Tier-1 tests and the runtime closure includes existing `src/core/fleet/metrics-feed.ts` outside the retained snapshot. No imports were added by this job; the failing paths and authority metadata are unchanged. Did not run `authority:regen`: AGENTS.md reserves closure snapshot regeneration to Mason.\n- `npm run typecheck`: passed (backend and web), exit 0.\n- `npm run lint`: failed missing TypeScript ESLint dependency resolution. Retry `NODE_PATH=\"$PWD/node_modules/.pnpm/node_modules\" npm run lint`: interrupted with SIGINT after ten minutes without lint output (exit 130); full-tree lint remains unverified. `lsof -Fpc /tmp/rq4742-lint-retry.log` identified only this run's processes, and `kill -INT 5280` stopped its ESLint child. This supplies the installed pnpm dependency lookup path without changing lint configuration.\n- `npm run lint:realio-lane && npm run lint:verse-sync-io`: first guard failed on 17 existing tests missing real-I/O membership; the second command was not reached. Separate `npm run lint:verse-sync-io`: passed. All reported real-I/O paths, the guard, and its membership config are unchanged by this job.\n- `NODE_PATH=\"$PWD/node_modules/.pnpm/node_modules\" node node_modules/eslint/bin/eslint.js src/cli/completions.ts src/cli/wb.ts test/wb-secrets-cli.test.ts`: passed.\n- `npm run check:docs`: final run passed. `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nNet LOC excluding this report: 16 tracked paths, 109 insertions / 90 deletions, net +19. This report adds 26 lines; total net +45 across 17 paths. Every authored change remains uncommitted. No security gate, workflow, live fleet script, release publisher, branch/tag, or auth setting changed. Hosted Merge Gate and enqueue are unverified and incomplete.\n</details>\n",
